A once-peaceful town has fallen silent… except for the echoes of the undead. Now, only twelve survivors remain, united by one mission: end the mysterious breakout before it reaches the world beyond. Fight through relentless waves, uncover the truth behind the infection, upgrade your arsenal, and push your limits as you battle to take the town back.

